    },
    {
      "id": "82IHRX8JC7T0ZemV4xcgO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -944.3523430390663,
      "y": 927.3526117358995,
      "width": 524.7594604492188,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1908506735,
      "version": 803,
      "versionNonce": 1375734239,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792827231826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The whole point, that a real DNA of tree\ndoesn't contain data like width and height.\nTree only has genome, physically has a posX and posY\nand informatically an id, to seperate from other trees",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The whole point, that a real DNA of tree\ndoesn't contain data like width and height.\nTree only has genome, physically has a posX and posY\nand informatically an id, to seperate from other trees",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ndr5rb19H8ZViNVEMgVx5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -946.2988802084732,
      "y": 1067.534278889818,
      "width": 963.3592529296875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 557301263,
      "version": 781,
      "versionNonce": 1963393814,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792234311970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what is a Genome?:\n-def: A genome is the complete set of genetic material (DNA or RNA)\nbelonging to an organism, acting as the instruction manual for building, growing, and maintaining life\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what is a Genome?:\n-def: A genome is the complete set of genetic material (DNA or RNA)\nbelonging to an organism, acting as the instruction manual for building, growing, and maintaining life\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "orL3_awtknXZJbxrT7wVq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -940.5286912909437,
      "y": 1214.8304321995656,
      "width": 840.5794677734375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
