      "updated": 1792234311970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "there will be the random. All the seeds have the\nsame genetic code, so or all the seeds will be same\nas they ancestor(plant) or a bit else.\nthe chance of the mutation will be inside the genom.\nSo even the chance of mutation growth can change\non mutation :D",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0t9PHWBiHWmpUaANZNiWu",
      "originalText": "there will be the random. All the seeds have the same genetic code, so or all the seeds will be same as they ancestor(plant) or a bit else.\nthe chance of the mutation will be inside the genom.\nSo even the chance of mutation growth can change on mutation :D",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
